('bdd640fb-0667-1ad1-1c80-317fa3b1799d','skeletal','simple','click_organ','Click the part of the body that does this job: “It protects your brain, holds your eyes safe and gives your face its shape.”','{}'::jsonb,'The skull: it protects your brain, holds your eyes safe and gives your face its shape.','skull'),
